+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds: an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in dev builds was explicitly retired in favor of enforcing verification everywhere, so no build configuration should carry an exception that skips certificate checks.
